{
  "_about": "Hand-authored synthetic dataset for the Pass 2 evaluation contract. It contains NO real legislation and NO human judgments -- every 'adjudicator' is 'synthetic'. Its only job is to prove, before any human labels anything, that the frozen schema can produce all five promised metrics and that the anti-circularity exclusion actually excludes. One record per shape the design must handle: clean one-to-one, no counterpart, one-to-many with a retrieval gap, a candidate miss found only by browsing, a ranking miss, an assignment collision with one winner and one loser, a suggestion-list-only truth that must be excluded from candidate recall, an uncertain, and a challenge-stratum failure.",
